# Per-job training artefacts. `SPATIAL_JOB=combine` reads these to assemble the
# pack; only the assembled pack is shipped. Keeping them locally makes a
# re-combine cheap, which is why they are ignored rather than deleted.
content/packs/propagation-model/.parts/
